Z||000000||JohnnyK||11-27-2001||06:38 PM||||So I take my Fiero to my work to see if we can do a quick safety check on it (Thing hasn't been driven in months and months).. fire it up in the morning.. Thing is running like GARBAGE.. I'm saying I could run faster than it would move (4cyl).. "Putt, putt, putt", as in, it wouldn't rev at all... It reved better as soon as it made it's way up to redline (took forever).. eventually it started running "better".. anyways, got to work, my luck, we didn't even get to bring it in. Way back home, running even worse.. Stalling at lights when trying to accelerate, and then the alt light comes on.. Gotta go back to the parking lot where i left it and install a belt. sheesh..||||reg||1
